# --- generated data / artefacts -------------------------------------------------
# The packed store is ~4 GB. Never commit it -- rebuild it with 00_pack_sources.py
# or attach it on Kaggle as a private dataset.
store/
*.i16
*.wav
*.flac
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt

# Run outputs
runs/
ckpt/
outputs/
eda/
eval/
interpret/
search/
*.log
train_log.csv
history.json

# --- what IS committed, deliberately --------------------------------------------
# data/recipes_dev.csv and data/recipes_test.csv ARE committed. The frozen evaluation
# sets are recipes, not audio (a few hundred kB), and version-controlling them is what
# "freeze the test set" actually means. No *.csv rule above, so they are tracked --
# this note exists so nobody "tidies up" by adding one. See data/README.md.

